+    ``waiting on … after 30s/60s/90s`` is not Frontier-like and does not
+    make prefill faster. CLI still rewrites the spinner. Reconnect and
+    incomplete-response notices still go through ``_emit_wait_notice``.
+    """
+    platform = str(getattr(agent, "platform", "") or "").lower()
+    if platform in _QUIET_WAIT_PLATFORMS:
+        touch = getattr(agent, "_touch_activity", None)
+        if callable(touch):
