+                    f"Fixed timeout={timeout.value:g}s on /tmp/anc.js is blocked because "
+                    "it can terminate healthy work before Hermes' execute_code deadline. "
+                    "Omit the nested timeout and rely on execute_code's outer budget."
+                )
